      "id": "seg:code:declaration:0006:0001",
      "source": "```swift\nfunc attach(_ spatialVideoConfiguration: AVSpatialVideoConfiguration, to pixelBuffer: inout CVMutablePixelBuffer) throws\n```",
      "ko": "```swift\nfunc attach(_ spatialVideoConfiguration: AVSpatialVideoConfiguration, to pixelBuffer: inout CVMutablePixelBuffer) throws\n```",
